# Google Maps JavaScript API key. Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis
# (enable "Maps JavaScript API"; Google requires a billing account on the project).
# Copy this file to ".env" and paste your key after the equals sign.
# Restrict the key to your website's addresses in the Google Cloud console, since it is visible in the browser.
# Without a key the site falls back to the simple outline map and OpenStreetMap embeds.
NUXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
